OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins to replace station's
OL,4,Aageing footbridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FMulti-million pound work to replace a
OL,7,Frailway station's ageing footbridge has
OL,8,Fbegun, with disruption expected to last
OL,9,Ffor 12 months.
OL,11,FThe 79-year-old footbridge at Havant
OL,12,Fstation in Hampshire is located between
OL,13,FElmleigh Road and North Street.
OL,15,FHampshire County Council said the
OL,16,F#12.8m scheme would "provide a safer,
OL,17,Fmore accessible and attractive
OL,18,Fcrossing".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
